Note 2: Sometimes when you click on a link, your browser requests other files AT THE SAME TIME like Java scripts, web pages, pictures, etc. When you press and hold down a special key, New Download Manager intercepts these files, and the browser may not request the necessary file because it will not run a Javascript, which has been intercepted by New Download Manager erroneously. If you want to intercept and download only the necessary files with New Download Manager, please turn on the option below:=Note 2: Sometimes when you click on a link, your browser requests other files AT THE SAME TIME like Java scripts, web pages, pictures, etc. When you press and hold down a special key, New Download Manager intercepts these files, and the browser may not request the necessary file because it will not run a Javascript, which has been intercepted by New Download Manager erroneously. If you want to intercept and download only the necessary files with New Download Manager, please turn on the option below:
Note that all modern antiviral software have "real-time protection" feature that checks all operations with files on your computer, and it includes all files downloaded in NDM. Thus, you need to add antiviral software scanner to NDM settings only when real-time protection is turned off in antiviral software settings.\nAlso, in some cases, real time protection may significantly slow down the assembly of files made by NDM. Then you need to add ndm.exe process to exceptions according to antiviral software documentation, and set up antiviral checking on this dialog.=Note that all modern antiviral software have "real-time protection" feature that checks all operations with files on your computer, and it includes all files downloaded in NDM. Thus, you need to add antiviral software scanner to NDM settings only when real-time protection is turned off in antiviral software settings.\nAlso, in some cases, real time protection may significantly slow down the assembly of files made by NDM. Then you need to add ndm.exe process to exceptions according to antiviral software documentation, and set up antiviral checking on this dialog.
Note: "Start view" option doesn't relate to queue processing. When NDM is processing queues,  "Download progress" dialog always starts minimized in system tray=Note: "Start view" option doesn't relate to queue processing. When NDM is processing queues,  "Download progress" dialog always starts minimized in system tray
Note: Internet servers may break connection when the speed is too limited! Thus it's not recommended to use Speed Limiter to download from servers that do not support "resume" feature.=Note: Internet servers may break connection when the speed is too limited! Thus it's not recommended to use Speed Limiter to download from servers that do not support "resume" feature.
Note: NDM should be running in system tray at the specified time to start a scheduled project=Note: NDM should be running in system tray at the specified time to start a scheduled project
